<template>
  <main class="qvc-page">
    <header class="qvc-hero"><div><span class="qvc-kicker">QGAUSS / VOICE CONTROL</span><h1>让每一个好答案，<br>被温柔听见<span>。</span></h1><p>接入声音，让录音变成文字，让回答拥有自己的音色。</p><router-link to="/chat">回到对话，体验声音 <ClientIcon name="arrowUpRight" /></router-link></div><div class="qvc-sculpture" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>VOICE<br>WITH QGAUSS</span></div></header>
    <div class="qvc-overview"><article><span>01 / 服务状态</span><strong>{{ config?.enabled?'声音已开启':'等待声音就位' }}</strong><small>实际连通与音质，需要体验验证</small></article><article><span>02 / 声音角色</span><strong>6 <small>种原有音色</small></strong><small>清晰、温暖、明亮，各有表达</small></article><article><span>03 / 录音空间</span><strong>05:00 <small>最长录制</small></strong><small>先确认转写，再由用户发送消息</small></article></div>
    <p v-if="error" class="qvc-feedback error" role="alert">{{ error }}</p><p v-if="notice" class="qvc-feedback" role="status">{{ notice }}</p>
    <div v-if="loading" class="qvc-loading"><QLoader :size="40" />正在整理声音控制台…</div>
    <form v-else-if="config" class="qvc-config" @submit.prevent="save"><section class="qvc-card"><header><span class="qvc-symbol"><ClientIcon name="sound" /></span><div><h2>声音的两条旅程</h2><p>沿用已有渠道中的加密凭据，不必在这里填写密钥。</p></div></header><div class="qvc-form-grid"><fieldset><legend>回答朗读 <small>TEXT → VOICE</small></legend><label>语音服务渠道<select v-model="draft.speechChannelId" :disabled="saving"><option value="">暂不接入</option><option v-for="channel in compatibleChannels" :key="channel.id" :value="channel.id">{{ channel.name }}{{ channel.status==='ENABLED'?'':'（已停用）' }}</option></select></label><label>服务方朗读模型<input v-model="draft.speechModel" :disabled="saving" maxlength="128" required placeholder="tts-1" /></label><p>支持 OpenAI Speech 兼容接口。默认沿用原有 tts-1，实际模型名由服务方决定。</p></fieldset><fieldset><legend>录音转写 <small>VOICE → TEXT</small></legend><label>语音服务渠道<select v-model="draft.transcriptionChannelId" :disabled="saving"><option value="">暂不接入</option><option v-for="channel in compatibleChannels" :key="channel.id" :value="channel.id">{{ channel.name }}{{ channel.status==='ENABLED'?'':'（已停用）' }}</option></select></label><label>服务方转写模型<input v-model="draft.transcriptionModel" :disabled="saving" maxlength="128" required placeholder="whisper-1" /></label><p>最长五分钟的录音，使用兼容的 Transcriptions 接口。结果供用户检查和编辑。</p></fieldset></div><router-link class="qvc-config-link" to="/models/channels">管理渠道与加密凭据<ClientIcon name="arrowUpRight" /></router-link></section>
    <section class="qvc-card"><header><span class="qvc-symbol green"><ClientIcon name="wallet" /></span><div><h2>清楚的费用，安心地使用</h2><p>需要次数时，先展示整次费用；完整完成后才结算。</p></div></header><div class="qvc-billing-grid"><label>使用的次数池<select v-model="draft.pool" :disabled="saving"><option value="model3">低价模型次数</option><option value="model4">高价模型次数</option><option value="agent">智能体次数</option><option value="drawMj">绘图次数</option></select></label><label>每次完整朗读 / 试听<input v-model.number="draft.speechCost" type="number" min="0" max="1000000" step="1" required :disabled="saving" /></label><label>每次完整转写<input v-model.number="draft.transcriptionCost" type="number" min="0" max="1000000" step="1" required :disabled="saving" /></label><label>单次朗读字符上限<input v-model.number="draft.maxSpeechChars" type="number" min="100" max="32768" step="1" required :disabled="saving" /></label></div><div class="qvc-note"><strong>长回答按整次费用确认，分段连续朗读。</strong><span>0 表示不扣站点次数；商业化关闭或站点演示模式下不扣站点次数。服务方仍可能按字符或音频时长计费。</span><span>停止生成会中断当前连接；服务方是否继续处理与计费，以其账单为准。</span></div><label class="qvc-enable"><input v-model="draft.enabled" type="checkbox" :disabled="saving" /><span><strong>为用户开启语音工作区</strong><small>保存只更新设置。请在对话中明确试听与转写，核对真实效果后再开放。</small></span></label><div class="qvc-form-actions"><button type="button" class="qvc-secondary" :disabled="saving" @click="load">重新加载</button><button type="submit" class="qvc-primary" :disabled="saving">{{ saving?'正在保存…':'保存声音设置' }} <span>↗</span></button></div></section></form>
    <section class="qvc-card qvc-receipts"><header><span class="qvc-symbol pink"><ClientIcon name="file" /></span><div><h2>最近的声音回执</h2><p>保留状态与次数；这里不展示用户录音、转写内容或回答正文。</p></div><button type="button" class="qvc-secondary" :disabled="receiptLoading" @click="loadReceipts">刷新<ClientIcon name="refresh" /></button></header><div v-if="!receipts.length" class="qvc-empty"><div>✧</div><strong>第一段声音，还在路上</strong><p>用户明确发起语音后，处理状态会出现在这里。</p></div><div v-else class="qvc-receipt-list"><article v-for="receipt in receipts" :key="receipt.id"><div class="qvc-receipt-type"><ClientIcon :name="receipt.kind==='speech'?'sound':'microphone'" /></div><div class="qvc-receipt-copy"><strong>{{ receipt.kind==='speech'?(receipt.sample?'音色试听':'回答朗读'):'录音转写' }}<small>{{ receipt.kind==='speech'?voiceName(receipt.voice):`${Math.round(receipt.inputSeconds)} 秒` }}</small></strong><span>{{ receipt.model }} · {{ receipt.kind==='speech'?`${receipt.inputChars} 字符，${receipt.completedSegments}/${receipt.segmentCount} 段已收到`:'转写结果由用户本人查看' }}</span><small>{{ formatDate(receipt.createdAt) }} · {{ receipt.id }}</small></div><div class="qvc-receipt-state"><strong :class="receipt.status.toLowerCase()">{{ voiceTaskLabel(receipt) }}</strong><span>{{ receipt.billing.charged?`已结算 ${receipt.billing.charged} 次`:receipt.billing.reserved?`已预留 ${receipt.billing.reserved} 次`:receipt.billing.returned?`已退回 ${receipt.billing.returned} 次`:'未扣站点次数' }}</span><small v-if="receipt.possibleProviderCharge">已准备向服务方提交，实际费用以账单为准</small><small v-if="receipt.errorMessage">{{ receipt.errorMessage }}</small></div></article></div></section>
  </main>
</template>
<script setup>
import { computed, onMounted, onUnmounted, reactive, ref } from 'vue';
import { api } from '../../api/client.js';
import ClientIcon from '../../components/reference/ClientIcon.vue';
import QLoader from '../../components/QLoader.vue';
import { voiceName, voiceTaskLabel } from '../../lib/voice-presentation.js';
import { useAuth } from '../../stores/auth.js';
const auth=useAuth(),config=ref(null),channels=ref([]),draft=reactive({}),loading=ref(true),saving=ref(false),receipts=ref([]),receiptLoading=ref(false),error=ref(''),notice=ref('');let alive=true,revision=0,read;
const compatibleChannels=computed(()=>channels.value.filter(channel=>['OPENAI','CUSTOM'].includes(channel.type)));
const payload=()=>Object.fromEntries(['version','enabled','speechChannelId','transcriptionChannelId','speechModel','transcriptionModel','speechCost','transcriptionCost','pool','maxSpeechChars'].map(key=>[key,draft[key]]));
const formatDate=value=>new Date(value).toLocaleString('zh-CN',{hour12:false});
async function load(){const own=++revision,identity=auth.identityRevision;read?.abort();read=new AbortController();loading.value=true;error.value='';try{const [settings,available]=await Promise.all([api.get('/voice/admin/config',{signal:read.signal}),api.get('/models/channels',{signal:read.signal})]);if(!alive||own!==revision||identity!==auth.identityRevision)return;config.value=settings;Object.assign(draft,settings);channels.value=available;}catch(e){if(alive&&own===revision&&e.name!=='AbortError')error.value=e.message;}finally{if(alive&&own===revision)loading.value=false;}}
async function save(){if(saving.value)return;saving.value=true;error.value='';notice.value='';const own=revision,identity=auth.identityRevision;try{const next=await api.put('/voice/admin/config',payload());if(!alive||own!==revision||identity!==auth.identityRevision)return;config.value=next;Object.assign(draft,next);notice.value='声音设置已保存，尚未向服务方发起生成。';}catch(e){if(alive&&own===revision&&identity===auth.identityRevision)error.value=e.message;}finally{if(alive&&own===revision)saving.value=false;}}
async function loadReceipts(){if(receiptLoading.value)return;receiptLoading.value=true;const identity=auth.identityRevision;try{const rows=await api.get('/voice/admin/receipts');if(alive&&identity===auth.identityRevision)receipts.value=rows;}catch(e){if(alive&&identity===auth.identityRevision)error.value=e.message;}finally{if(alive)receiptLoading.value=false;}}
onMounted(()=>{void load();void loadReceipts();});onUnmounted(()=>{alive=false;revision++;read?.abort();});
</script>
